              <option value="FOB (Free On Board - Indian Ports)">FOB (Indian Sea / Air Ports)</option>
              <option value="CFR (Cost & Freight)">CFR (Cost & Freight)</option>
              <option value="EXW (Ex-Works Mill / Warehouse)">EXW (Ex-Works)</option>
